@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor sway
@conf hime-edit-display=2
@conf hime-on-the-spot-key=1
# Mouse actions commit text (the symbol table), change the preedit
# (candidates), and type keys (the virtual keyboard) without key events;
# the keys typed before stay in the preedit.
b @hook commit 測試 @check @hook preedit @check
<space> @check @hook key c @check @hook key space
